    "about.ack.content" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Special thanks to the following students for their contributions (in no particular order):\n\nZhai Zaijia — for detailed testing on Honor X20 and similar devices, helping find and fix multiple display issues.\n\nMan Junhao, Tian Dongmin, Wang Zhongrui and Liu — for comprehensive testing that fixed countless potential bugs.\n\nXiao Zhang Bob — for valuable feedback on information accuracy.\n\nThe app's continuous improvement would not be possible without every tester's hard work."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在此特别鸣谢以下同学对本软件的贡献支持（排名不分先后）：\n\n翟在家同学\n感谢你在荣耀X20等特定机型上进行的详细测试，帮助发现并解决了多个显示适配问题。\n\n满俊豪同学、田东民同学、王中睿同学、刘同学\n感谢你们对应用进行的全面测试，修复了无数潜在的BUG。\n\n小张Bob同学\n感谢你对应用信息准确性提出的宝贵意见，让应用内容更加准确可靠。\n\n本应用能够不断完善和适配更多设备，离不开各位测试同学的辛勤付出。正是你们的反馈和测试，才让这个应用变得更好。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "about.ack.title" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Acknowledgments"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "鸣谢"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "about.agreement" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "User Agreement"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用户协议"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "about.intro.content" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This app is developed by students of HMUDQ. All development and testing are done by fellow students — please forgive any bugs (and feel free to report them!).\n\nThe app is essentially a client for the university's academic system. When you tap login, it sends requests to the system on your behalf and presents the responses in a clean, readable way. Because of this, what the app can do is entirely limited by the academic system itself — it cannot (and has no ability to) hack into the system or anything else. With built-in caching, you can still view the last loaded schedule even when the academic system is down."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这是一款由医大在读学生们开发出来的软件。软件开发、测试全为本校学生，如有 bug 敬请谅解（同时欢迎反馈！）\n\n软件的原理就是套壳教务系统，当你点击登录时候，软件后台会同步向教务发送请求，同时将教务返回的信息美观、直接地展示在你眼前。正因为如此，这个软件能做的范围完全取决于教务系统，他不能（也没有能力）入侵系统或者做别的事情。同时，由于软件引入了缓存机制，在教务系统崩溃期间仍然可以看上一次加载的课程表，极大方便了同学的日常使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "about.intro.title" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "About This App"
